invariant: INV-5
file: pem_blocks.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: "-----BEGIN " that does not start its line is skipped as text,
  with the block's body and END line, so a bundle saved with a
  byte-order mark, or with a block indented, decodes with a root missing
  and reports CH_OK. test_bundle_grammar writes each in front of the
  first and of the second of two blocks and requires CH_EINVAL.

--- old
        if (pem_begins_boundary(r)) {
            return line_start ? NEXT_BLOCK : NEXT_REFUSED;
        }
--- new
        if (line_start && pem_begins_boundary(r)) {
            return NEXT_BLOCK;
        }
